      "content": "It's true that the advice you're getting is often empty platitudes when you're actually drowning. Those suggestions don't address the core of the exhaustion, and that's why they feel so useless. If the noise is becoming unbearable, and you're thinking about the quiet, that's a very serious sign that you need immediate, real-world help. Please call or text 988 right now; they are equipped to handle exactly this kind of crisis.",
