    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, calling a hotline feels so clinical and fake. it's just another person reading a script while i'm sitting here feeling like my life is a total wreck. i'm not looking for a script, i'm just looking for a way to make the weight go away. it feels like every single path i take leads back to this same hole. like, is it even worth fighting to stay in a race where you've already lost? everything just feels so futile and heavy.",
